.247 .025(nets are unstable \(Breiman [1996b]\).)J
78 573 :M
.866 .087(Unstable methods can have their accuracy improved by perturbing and combining.   That is--)J
78 585 :M
1.968 .197(generate multiple versions of the predictor by perturbing the training set or construction)J
78 597 :M
.543 .054(method.  Then combine these multiple versions into a single predictor.   For instance Ali [1995])J
78 609 :M
1.207 .121(generates multiple classification trees by choosing randomly from among the best splits at a)J
