.742 .074(The first four of the larger data sets were used in the Statlog Project \(Michie et.al. 1994\) which)J
90 93 :M
.388 .039(compared 22 classification methods.  Based on their results arc-fs ranks best on three of the four)J
90 105 :M
.133 .013(and is barely edged out of first place on DNA.  Arc-x4 is close behind.)J
90 129 :M
1.227 .123(The digit data set is the famous US Postal Service data set as preprocessed by Le Cun et. al)J
90 141 :M
.58 .058([1990] to result in 16x16 grey-scale images.   This data set has been used as a test bed for many)J
90 153 :M
1.426 .143(adventures in classification at AT&T Bell Laboratories.   The best two layer neural net gets)J
90 165 :M
2.184 .218(5.9% error rate.  A five layer network gets down to 5.1%.   Hastie and Tibshirani used)J
90 177 :M
1.296 .13(deformable prototypes [1994] and get to 5.5% error.  Using a very smart metric and nearest)J
90 189 :M
1.885 .188(neighbors gives the lowest error rate to date--2.7% \(P. Simard et. al [1993]\).  All of these)J
90 201 :M
1.479 .148(classifiers were specifically tailored for this data.)J
90 225 :M
1.803 .18(The interesting Support Vector machines described by Vapnik [1995] are off-the-shelf, but)J
90 237 :M
1.192 .119(require specification of some parameters and functions.  Their lowest error rates are slightly)J
90 249 :M
.898 .09(over 4%.   Use of the arcing algorithms and CART requires nothing other than reading in the)J
90 261 :M
.983 .098(training set, yet arc-fs gives accuracy competitive with the hand-crafted classifiers.   It is also)J
90 273 :M
.687 .069(relatively fast.  The 100 trees constructed in arc-fs on the digit data took about 4 hours of CPU)J
90 285 :M
-.004(time on a Sparc 20.   Some uncomplicated reprogramming would get this down to about one hour)A
90 297 :M
.331 .033(of CPU time.)J
90 321 :M
.402 .04(Looking over the test set error results, there is little to choose between arc-fs and arc-x4.  Arc-x4)J
90 333 :M
.635 .064(has a slight edge on the smaller data sets, while arc-fs does a little better on the larger ones.)J
