1.048 .105(Arc-fs and other arcing algorithms can reduce the test set error of methods like CART to the)J
90 117 :M
1.09 .109(point where they are the most accurate available off-the-shelf classifiers on a wide variety of)J
90 129 :M
1.084 .108(data sets.  The Freund-Schapire discovery of adaptive resampling  as embodied in arc-fs is a)J
90 141 :M
2.061 .206(creative idea which should lead to interesting research and better understanding of how)J
90 153 :M
1.723 .172(classification works.   The arcing algorithms have a rich probabilistic structure and it is a)J
90 165 :M
.486 .049(challenging problem to connect this structure to their error reduction properties.   It is not clear)J
90 177 :M
.759 .076(what an optimum arcing algorithm would look like.  Arc-fs was devised in a different context)J
90 189 :M
.761 .076(and arc-x4 is ad-hoc.  While the concepts of bias and variance seem suitable as an explanation)J
90 201 :M
1.04 .104(for bagging, and while arcing does effectively reduce variance, the bias-variance setting does)J
